{"id": "t079-003", "text": "Jack - made redundant Fri, whole team gone, 3 months pay. v flat about it, said he'd seen it coming since the restructure in Aug. his gf Hannah's being great. thinking of going freelance or maybe back to uni early next yr. check in sometime next week, prob take him for a pint", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jack", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "made redundant", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Fri", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "flat", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "since the restructure in Aug"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gf", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hannah", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of going freelance", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "back to uni", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next yr", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him for a pint", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t079-006", "text": "Ali's mum - hip op 3rd of June @ Northwick Park. Ali v anxious, she's 78 + had a bad reaction last time. he's taking the wk off to look after her, his brother Hamza covering the wkend after. Ali's wife Efua doing meals. message Ali on the 3rd to see how it went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "hip op", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "3rd of June", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "78", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "had a bad reaction last time", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking the wk off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hamza", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the wkend after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p5", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Ali", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ali", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t079-012", "text": "Michael - laid off @ the bank after 12 yrs, found out Tues, out by end of the month. told me at Gemma's. says he's fine but def not, kept changing the subject. wife Natasha back at work so money ok for now but mortgage worries. his boss didn't even tell him in person. remind me to ring him over the wkend + send him that recruiter's number", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "laid off @ the bank", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tues"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "fine but def not", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Natasha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "back at work", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "mortgage worries", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "boss", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the wkend", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him that recruiter's number", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "recruiter"}]}
{"id": "t079-013", "text": "Anan & Lior - expecting!! due over the summer, roughly mid July. found out at the 12 wk scan last Mon. Lior's sister Carmen already planning the baby shower sometime in June, wants me to help w/ food. Anan's mum over the moon, 1st grandchild. Lior has bad morning sickness tho", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "expecting", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the summer", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "roughly mid July", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "12 wk scan", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "last Mon", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Carmen", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "baby shower", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in June", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anan", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "over the moon", "fact_type": "feeling", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "1st grandchild", "fact_type": "other", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "bad morning sickness", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p2"}]}
{"id": "t079-017", "text": "Mariam - from Bradford orig, now Bristol. 2 sisters, younger one Anjali at uni in Leeds", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mariam", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Bradford orig", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "Bristol", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "2 sisters", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "younger one", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "at uni in Leeds", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}]}
{"id": "t079-020", "text": "Finn - dumped by Matilda (Tilly) after 3 yrs, out of the blue on his bday. staying at his brother Tunde's in Peckham for a bit till he finds somewhere. Tunde says he's barely sleeping. their mum's coming down from Leeds 10th-12th Nov. Finn wants to keep busy so offered him 5 a side Weds", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dumped", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Matilda", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tilly", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "his bday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p4", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tunde", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "barely sleeping", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Leeds", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "10th-12th Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "p6", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "5 a side", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Weds", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t079-021", "text": "Gemma - Brighton, works from home, UX at a startup. mum lives w/ her", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Gemma", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Brighton", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "home"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "works from home", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "UX at a startup", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "lives w/ her", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "home"}]}
