{"id": "t079-045", "text": "Tomás - his partner Michael left him after 6 yrs. came out of nowhere apparently, M moving to Leeds w/ someone from work. they're selling the house in Hove, viewings start early Jan. T staying w/ me for a few nights from Fri, I'm doing the spare room. their dog Olive going w/ T. he's not eating much. should take him out for food Sat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "fact_type": "relationship", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Michael", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "left him", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "M", "pronoun": "unknown", "owner": "p1", "same_as": "p2"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Leeds", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the house in Hove", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewings", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early Jan", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "T", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying w/ me", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "a few nights from Fri", "anchor": "e5"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Olive", "fact_type": "pet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p5", "type": "PERSON", "text": "T", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "not eating much", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for food", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sat", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t079-046", "text": "Lior's parents - 40th anniv party 16th of Dec. Lior asked if I can help w/ the playlist", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "40th anniv party", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "16th of Dec", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lior", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t079-050", "text": "Finn's grandma - in hospital since Tues after a fall, broke her wrist + bit confused. he's visiting every eve after work, his mum doing days. they're hoping she's home by the end of the week but might need carers. ask how she is when I see him Thurs", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Finn", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandma", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since Tues", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "broke her wrist", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "bit confused", "fact_type": "health", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the week"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask how she is", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when I see him Thurs", "anchor": "a1"}]}
