{"id": "t079-055", "text": "Rafael's dad died early hours Sat, after the scan stuff in Nov. funeral 2nd of Dec, crem then the Crown after. R says no flowers, donations to the hospice instead. his sister Sofia flying back from Toronto on the 28th. R doing the eulogy and dreading it. need to donate + ask Raf if he wants me to read it through w/ him before", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early hours Sat", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "scan stuff", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Nov", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "2nd of Dec", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "R", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f4", "type": "FACT", "text": "no flowers", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f5", "type": "FACT", "text": "donations to the hospice", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back from Toronto", "owner": "p3", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "R", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e5", "type": "EVENT", "text": "eulogy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading it", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", 